es, contracts and other papers, linked to the records they belong to.", "Equipment lookup" => "Find any serial unit: where it is, who has it, its warranty and full history.", "Installations" => "Schedule installations, record commissioning checks and customer acceptance.", "Approvals" => "Sales, reversals, stock adjustments and vouchers held by the business controls, waiting for a decision.", "Controls & exceptions" => "Set approval limits and review reversals, back-dating, discounts, stock adjustments and after-hours work.", "Company & tax" => "Company identifiers, tax categories and returns, fiscal registration and the look of printed documents.", "Variants & bundles" => "Products in several colours, sizes or finishes, and package prices for products sold together.", "Reminders" => "What needs attention: deadlines, renewals, overdue accounts, waiting approvals and stock to reorder.", "System health" => "Version, database, backups, integrity and background tasks.", "Price rules" => "Promotions and special prices by product, category, customer type, quantity and date.", "Financial statements" => "Profit and loss, balance sheet, cash flow and funds flow, and closing the financial year.", "Banking tools" => "Your bank's statement layouts, cheques you have written, and which cashiers use each cash drawer.", "Dashboard" => "Sales, profit, cash, debts, stock and operations at a glance. Select any figure to see what makes it up.", "Reports" => "Sales analysis, day book and ledgers, stock valuation and movements, and ageing — each total reconciled and every line traceable to its document.", "Service jobs" => "Repairs, warranty claims, parts used and preventive maintenance visits, from fault report to invoice.", "Equipment setup" => "Warranty and installation terms, checklists and compatible items for each model.", "Periods & tax" => "Close accounting periods and configure future sales tax rates.", "Trial balance" => "Reconcile the accounting behind your business.", _ => "Review local activity and synchronization readiness." };
    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync() => await Run(async () => { moneyFormat = (await PrintSetups.Load(Services)).Company; await LoadBundles(); data = await Business.Read(Actor); locations = await Inventory.Locations(); parties = await Parties.Read(); inventorySettings = await InventoryManagement.Products(); currencies = (await Purchasing.Rates()).Select(x => x.Currency).Distinct().ToList(); });
    private bool HasDraft => page is "New sale" or "Receive stock" && (heldSaleId is not null || holdLabel.Length > 0 || scanCode.Length > 0 || expiry is not null || dueDate is not null || businessDate != DateOnly.FromDateTime(DateTime.UtcNow) || lines.Count > 0 || selectedProduct != Guid.Empty || linePrice != 0 || quantity != 1 || conversion != 1 || !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(serial) || !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(batch) || !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(paymentReference) || !string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(bank) || settlement != "Cash" || party != (page == "New sale" ? "Walk-in" : ""));
